<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/topbar') %>
<main class="review-page">
  <header class="review-head">
    <p class="home-eyebrow"><span class="home-eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>每日复习</p>
    <h1>先回忆，再核对</h1>
    <p class="review-lead">从全站 <%= questionCount %> 道“读完自测”中抽题。按分支筛选，错题优先；同一道题连续答对两次后，会自动移出随机池。先自己回答，再展开答案。</p>
    <div class="review-controls">
      <label class="review-field" for="review-branch">领域
        <select id="review-branch">
          <option value="">全部分支</option>
          <% reviewBranches.forEach(function (b) { %>
          <option value="<%= b.id %>"><%= b.name %></option>
          <% }); %>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="review-toggle" for="review-wrong-only">
        <input type="checkbox" id="review-wrong-only" />
        <span>只练错题</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div class="review-progress-wrap">
      <div class="review-progress-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span id="review-progress-fill"></span></div>
      <span id="review-progress" class="review-progress" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="review-actions">
      <button id="review-new" class="review-btn primary" type="button">换一组</button>
      <button id="review-reset" class="review-btn" type="button">清空记录</button>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section id="review-daily" class="review-daily" aria-labelledby="review-daily-title" hidden></section>
  <ol id="review-list" class="review-list"></ol>
  <p class="review-empty" id="review-empty" hidden>题库加载失败。直接打开任意页面，做页尾的“读完自测”也可以。</p>
  <noscript><p class="review-empty">这个页面需要 JavaScript 才能随机抽题。</p></noscript>
  <p class="review-back"><a href="guide/learning-paths.html">← 返回学习路径</a> · <a href="diagnose.html">故障诊断向导 →</a></p>
</main>
<%- include('partials/sitefooter') %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
<script src="js/review.js?v=<%= v %>"></script>
